  designNotes: 'Destroy target creature (its Last Will happens); the other creatures
    on its side get +2 Attack while they stay in play, rallied by the outrage (the
    user, 2026-10-15: only the side where it was destroyed). Your own, to rally your
    side; theirs, to remove a threat at a price.'
